# Compact ice grid for the V23/V24 comparison (Baum agg: V24 must equal V23)
# (validation/v24/scattering_refinements/compact_lut.py).  Not a production
# grid: every value is a node of the approved Grid B ice-cloud.lut.
4 uneven_logarithmic # optical depth
0.125 1.0 8.0 64.0
3 uneven_linear # physical effective radius, microns
5.0 41.0 93.0
3 uneven_linear # solar zenith, degrees
0.0 30.0 60.0
3 uneven_linear # satellite zenith, degrees
0.0 30.0 60.0
7 linear # relative azimuth, degrees, 0-180
0 180
